<title>SPAIN: Spain's Rojo says '97 inflation target 2.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Spain's Rojo says '97 inflation target 2.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Spain Governor Luis Angel Rojo said on Tuesday that the 1997 inflation target was around 2.5 percent, falling to around two percent in 1998.</p>
</text>
